{"ID":"20240206102751-ifaikpu","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240206102751-ifaikpu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102751-ifaikpu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102800-d7nru05\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102754-k2m816z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102800-d7nru05\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:144,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:144\u0026#125;","title":" 桑椹（桑葚）","type":"doc","updated":"20240830102003"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206102800-d7nru05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102800-d7nru05","updated":"20240206102805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产浙江、江苏、安徽、新疆等地。\n【性状】\t该品为聚花果，由多数小核果集合而成，呈长圆形，长12cm，直径0.50.8cm。黄棕色、棕红色至暗紫色，(比较少见的颜色成熟后呈乳白色)，有短果序梗。小核果卵圆形，稍扁，长约2mm，宽约1mm，外具肉质花被片4 枚。气微，味微酸而甜。\n【性味】\t甘、酸，寒。\n【功效】\t补血滋阴，生津润燥。用于眩晕耳鸣，心悸失眠，须发早白，津伤口渴，内热消渴，血虚便秘。补肝，益肾，熄风，滋液。治肝肾阴亏，消渴，便秘，目暗，耳鸣，瘰疬，关节不利。"}]},{"ID":"20240206102754-k2m816z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102754-k2m816z","updated":"20240206102754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206102754-46yf222.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240829175049-m53lk2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240829175049-m53lk2l","updated":"20240829175049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 303px;","style":"width: 293px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","D